[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_1]
Southern Hooflyn Warfare

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_1_desc]
The Starlight Resistance army took the Southern Hooflyn City with the speed of blitzkrieg, the initial victory gradually boosted the morale of the Starlight Resistance army.
Meanwhile, Gladmane also issued a statement that the security forces of Manehattan have been assembled and can “reoccupy the city” at any time. However, there are also ponies within the security forces who have expressed that the loss of the Southern Hooflyn City has disrupted the entire deployment of the security forces, and the so-called reinforcements are just self-deceiving lies. As after the loss of the area, Gladmane has already withdrawn the remaining forces in the area to the southern area or the Manehattan capital.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_1_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_2]
Liberation of Southern Hooflyn!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_2_desc]
Great News! The army of the Starlight Resistance has successfully liberated the Southern Hooflyn City today!
The army that entered the city was warmly welcomed by the citizens, and joyful ponies took to the streets to celebrate the liberation of Hooflyn! This city has been oppressed and exploited for a long time, and the ponies have lived in poverty and fear. However, today is the day they break free from the darkness! The army of the Starlight Resistance has brought freedom and hope, and our army is not only a liberator, but also a guardian.
The liberation of Southern Hooflyn City is not only a military victory, but also a powerful counterattack against oppression and tyranny. The remnants of the slaver Gladmane’s army have been completely defeated, and our brave soldiers have captured their strongholds throughout the city. The end of Gladmane and his counter-revolutionary group is near, and we believe that through our joint efforts, the entire Eastern Equestria will soon be truly liberated and usher in a bright future!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_2_o0]
Excellent!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_3]
Fall of Southern Hooflyn

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_3_desc]
Recently, without any warning, a group of self-proclaimed “Liberation Front” bandits invaded and occupied the Southern Hooflyn City. They disregarded the property of the masses, looted and destroyed all the economic achievements of Hooflyn under the management of the Gladmane Group. The residents of Southern Hooflyn City did not welcome these invaders, and they took to the streets to protest the illegal invasion of Hooflyn by the so-called “Liberation Front”. However, they were brutally suppressed.
We must remember that they are not fighting alone: the Gladmane Group is not just a profit-oriented enterprise, but also a socially responsible enterprise! The Gladmane Group will actively support Hooflyn’s resistance to the aggressors, and the Gladmane Group will provide all necessary weapons, equipment and material assistance at an unprecedented 40% discount!
To further support Hooflyn’s freedom and development rights, the Gladmane Group announced that from today, the prices of all its products will be raised by 5%, and this 5% will be used to support Hooflyn’s resistance movement!
Supporting the Gladmane Group is supporting Hooflyn! Supporting the Gladmane Group is supporting freedom!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_3_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_4]
Farrier Hill Warfare

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_4_desc]
Though Gladmane Group has got military aid from the Equestria Empire, the offensive of the Starlight Resistance has not been weakened. Recently, the army of the Starlight Resistance has taken a major supply center - Farrier Hill. The fall of the area means that the supply source of Manehattan has been basically cut off, and it also means that the connection between the Manehattan war zone and the southern war zone has been cut off, and Manehattan is gradually becoming an island. Gladmane began to mobilize all the forces that can be mobilized in Manehattan, including the elderly, the young and even pregnant ponies. It is at this time that the ponies finally realize that Manehattan will face a big war!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_4_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_5]
Farrier Hill Liberated!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_5_desc]
Latest news, our soldiers have liberated the entire Farrier Hill area! This area has important strategic significance, it is an important supply area, the enemy did not have time to destroy all the supply centers and railways when they retreated. The railway was repaired quickly with the efforts of the local people, and it is believed that it will be able to be used again soon. The liberation of Farrier Hill also means that we will completely isolate the Manehattan gang, and they will face a crisis of supply shortage soon. It is worth noting that in the process of counting the captured weapons, we found that many of the weapons here are made in Canterlot, which means that the Equestria Empire has begun to interfere in this war. We will continue to pay attention to related messages.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_5_o0]
TODO

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_6]
Fall of Farrier Hill

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_6_desc]
The aggression of our enemies seems to be faster than we expected. We just received news that the so-called “Liberation Front” bandits have occupied the entire Farrier Hill area. This means that our contact with the Southern Theater is being cut off, and the entire Manehattan is will face the “Red Threat”.
Therefore, from now on, every employee of the Manehattan Group, regardless of gender, regardless of age, regardless of whether they are residents or sl... uh... slightly more hardworking contract labors, all have the obligation to defend Manehattan. We will establish the “Manehattan Civil Defense Force”. In addition, the Equestria Empire has agreed to provide military assistance to us, which is something the enemy does not want to see, because they are extremely short of weapons, and Manehattan will be their burial ground.
Believe in the Gladmane Group! All glory to Manehattan!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_6_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_7]
Resistance Occupies Manehattan

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_7_desc]
Major news! According to the report by “Red Radio”, the Resistance’s army has broken through the blockade of Manehattan and entered Manehattan! Despite the Manehattan authorities using all means, such as warships blockading the strait, setting up barricades in the city, and blocking all roads, etc, our army surges like an ever-flowing river and we broke through their blockade. We faced almost no resistance from the enemy’s positions, and our soldiers entered the city like it was unguarded. The Resistance held a grand entrance ceremony, and the citizens welcomed our arrival, with bright hopes for the future of Manehattan.
On the third day after entering the city, the Resistance held a grand military parade, and our army displayed many weapons and equipment captured from the enemy, including firearms, cannon, wands, etc. Our great leader — Starlight Glimmer — gave a speech on the parade platform: “Manehattan ponies, soldiers of the Resistance, comrades, hello! Here, I solemnly declare, Manehattan, is liberated!”
“The tyranny and slave trade of the Gladmane Group are gone forever in Manehattan! This is your victory, congratulations!”
“Remember not to be arrogant, as this is not our final victory. Our goal is to liberate the entire control area of the Gladmane Group, and then liberate the entire Equestria! We must be brave, move forward, fight, and pursue all the enemy who dare to resist!”
“To liberation!”

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_7_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_8]
Liberation of Manehattan

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_8_desc]
TODO

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_8_o0]
Viva la libertad!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_9]
Fall of Manehattan

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_9_desc]
Dear Valued Citizens of Manehattan,
It is with a heavy heart that we, the esteemed members of the Gladmane Group, must inform you of our temporary closure of the Manehattan branch. As you may already be aware, the recent events have led to the so-called “Liberation Front” taking control of the city, which is severely affecting our business operations.
Rest assured, dear citizens, employees, and customers, that we are doing everything in our power to ensure the safety and well-being of our staff and assets. Every employee with unpaid salary will be compensated in full when the “Liberation Front” is defeated, and every customer with orders pending will receive a full refund after the reopening of our Manehattan branch. We are currently working with the Equestria Empire authorities to resolve this matter as quickly as possible, and we hope to reopen our doors to you in the near future. Meanwhile, please stay patient and wait for further notice.
We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause, and we thank you for your continued support and understanding.
Sincerely,
Gladmane Group

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_9_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_10]
Fillydelphia Warfare

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_10_desc]
At a peaceful and quiet night, the residents of Fillydelphia had already fallen asleep, and the whole city was completely in its dream. Suddenly, a burst of gunfire broke the tranquility of the city, and there was no doubt that the Starlight Resistance launched a general attack on the city. Although the gunfire was deafening, the citizens did not panic. For them, this was the who-knows-how-many-th time that the Starlight Resistance had attacked the city. Every attack made the army of the Starlight Resistance suffer heavy casualties, but to no avail. This made the Gladmane Group in the city proud, and the ponies gradually adapted to the siege. But the next morning, the ponies woke up only to find that the flags of the Gladmane Group on the streets had been replaced by the flags of the Starlight Resistance. Thus, the barrier of the Gladmane Group in the southern war zone was broken.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_10_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_11]
Fillydelphia Liberated!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_11_desc]
Comrades, we have successfully liberated Fillydelphia! We have opened the door to the south, and this is a decisive victory, the remaining forces of the Gladmane Group are few.
We have lost many soldiers in the battle, they are the heroes of this battle. Because of these brave sacrifices, our offensive will never stop.
We are the future of Equestria. We will move forward and sing loudly to bury the Gladmane reactionary group!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_11_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_12]
Fall of Fillydelphia

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_12_desc]
What’s going on? Don’t these ponies ever sleep?
They’ve been attacking us all day, and while they’ve broken through a number of our defenses, they’ve paid dearly for it. The enemy dead are piled so high that they’re actually “repairing” our trenches. We thought that they would give up on their “southern campaign” after paying such a heavy price.
We were wrong. They chose to attack under the cover of night, and we were caught off guard. We fled Manehatten and watched as their flag was raised over the city. There’s no stopping them now.
There is one piece of good news, though. I guess we won’t have to pay back all the loans of the Gladmane Group.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_12_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_13]
Baltimare Warfare

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_13_desc]
Before the southward aggression of the Starlight Resistance, Gladmane implemented the “fortress policy” in all the important areas in the south of eastern Equestria. Gladmane claimed that under the protection of layers of fortresses and barricades, the army of the Starlight Resistance would suffer heavy casualties and be unable to launch an attack.
However, to the surprise of the defenders, the most solid fortresses were often broken from the inside. In the propaganda of the Red Radio, the defenders of Baltimare collapsed without a fight, and the army of the Starlight Resistance and the rebels captured Baltimare in just a few days.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_13_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_14]
Baltimare Uprising!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_14_desc]
Comrades, the ponies of Baltimare have made the right choice. They have taken up arms and fought the enemy. After a day and a night of fighting, our fellow ponies have taken the city hall of Baltimare.
The red flag has risen in Baltimare. The days of the reactionary Gladmane Group are numbered.
Victory will belong to the masses of Baltimare! Victory will belong to the Resistance! Victory will belong to the cause of liberation of Equestria!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_14_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_15]
Rebellion Baltimare

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_15_desc]
Gladmane Group’s monthly report, a video from the stationed troops in Baltimare.
A young deputy captain of the grassroots security team reported in front of the camera:
“Report to the board of directors, the innocent and ignorant residents of the city have believed the despicable false propaganda of Starlight Glimmer, and there are too many of them. Our security forces in Baltimare were quickly suppressed, and they quickly took over the entire city——”
The deputy captain was interrupted, and the captain appeared on the camera:
“But they can’t continue to be rampant, our high-quality army has been assembled and ready to recapture Baltimare at any time. We believe that the battle will end soon, after all, these thugs are just a bunch of... mobs! Report over!”
The video ends.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_15_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_16]
Doom of the CMC

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_16_desc]
According to reliable sources, the army of the Equestria Empire has occupied the Twilight Castle, and the last army of the Cutie Mark Crusaders has also been destroyed under the iron hoof of the empire. The legend of the Cutie Mark Crusaders has come to an end. To celebrate this victory, the Empress has arranged a banquet in Canterlot City to entertain the leaders of various duchies. At present, the empire is still immersed in the joy of this “pacification”, and the Empress has not even realized that this is just the beginning of a war, not the end.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_16_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_17]
Equestria Empire Cleansing the Everfree Forest

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_17_desc]
Empress Cozy Glow announced the crusade against the Discord Legion that has been hiding in the Everfree Forest. The Empire claimed that this action was to further eradicate the hidden threats of Equestria to stabilize the turbulent situation in Ponyville, Canterlot, and everywhere else.
The top brasses of the Empire’s army is very confident about this action, they claimed: “Before sunset, the soldiers of the Empire will be able to return home and drink afternoon tea.”
But they seem to have underestimated the power of the Discord Legion, especially the leader of the legion - Discord. And, according to reliable sources, the Starlight Resistance is sending troops to the Empire’s border, and the Empire is likely to be involved in a protracted war of attrition on two fronts.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_17_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_18]
The Great Empress Cozy Glow’s Canterlot Parade Speech

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_18_desc]
Attention all ponies, the Great Empress Cozy Glow is speaking:
“My fellow ponies, I am pleased that we have made the decision to quell the rebellion of Discord, this means that the borders of our empire will be more secure than ever before.”
“The Empire of Equestria will show its strength, these rebels are nothing but a bunch of scum, I believe that before sunset, the empire’s soldiers will be able to return home and drink afternoon tea!”
“We have schools, they do not; we have abundant food, they do not; we have warm beds, while they can only sleep in the forest. These are the reasons why we will definitely win!”

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_18_o0]
Glory to Empress!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_19]
Discord’s prewar mobilization speech...?

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_19_desc]
“Hey! Today, I stand before you, not as your humble jester, but as the orchestrator of chaos and the master of mayhem. Yes, it is I, Discord, King of Chaos, here to entertain you with a prewar mobilization speech like no other!”
“Emm... in case you don’t understand how stand-up comedy works, it’s time to clap now.” (applause)
“Thank you! Thank you! Now, just think for a second, why would the Empire want to find us? I mean, if you want to find chaos, you don’t need to look any further than their bureaucracy!” (canned laughter)
“But fear not, my dear forest-dwelling friends! We won’t let them trample all over our precious trees and turn the Everfree into a concrete jungle. Oh no they won’t! We’ll fight back with a dash of magic, a sprinkle of madness, and maybe a pinch of glitter, just to confuse them!” (canned laughter)
“And to our brave soldiers heading into battle, I have a few words of wisdom for you. Remember, war is like a game of chess, except the chessboard is on fire.” (canned laughter)
“... the pieces have minds of their own.” (canned laughter)
“... and the rules change every five minutes.” (canned laughter)
“... more like chess-boxing, really.” (canned laughter)
“... or just boxing.” (canned laughter)
“... but do remember to bring a gun, you guys.” (canned laughter)
“My point is, the war must have been more confusing to the Empire soliders more than it was to us. After all, they have to learn the latest in cutting-edge equipment, those from a few centuries ago.” (canned laughter)
“As for we, we have nothing to lose, and everything to gain. So, my brave soldiers, go forth, fight with all your might!” (applause)

“For Equestria!” (“For Equestria!”)
“For Chaos!” (“For Chaos!”)
“For Fun!” (“For Fun!”, canned laughter)
“For Everfree! Pun intended.” (“For Everfree! Pun intended.”)
“Hey, don’t repeat that one!” (canned laughter)

“For Fluttershy!” (“For Fluttershy!”)

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_19_o0]
“For Fluttershy!”

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_20]
The Highland Offensive

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_20_desc]
According to reliable sources, the army of the Starlight Resistance has broken through the Empire’s defenses in the highlands. The highland defense line is the most important part of the Mareginot defense line. This means that the Mareginot defense line has actually lost its strategic significance, and the entire Empire’s front line has to be adjusted to the rear. This move by the Starlight Resistance will undoubtedly boost the confidence of the troops, but the army has suffered heavy losses in this battle, which may affect the smooth progress of its offensive.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_20_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_21]
Highland Liberated!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_21_desc]
Well done, pony comrades! Our soldiers have taken the Highland fortress, which means we have broken through the Mareginot Line, and the “blockade” boasted by the pseudo-empire is nothing more than that. But we cannot be complacent because of this. Although we have won a major victory, we have not eliminated the enemy’s combat power. They will regroup to deal with us, and we must be prepared for the next offensive. But to be honest, the enemy’s “retreat” speed is faster than Angel the rabbit.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_21_o0]
It’s over Cozy, I have the Highland!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_22]
The Highland Line has fallen

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_22_desc]
What’s going on? We just received news that the Highland Line has fallen! How is this possible? This is the defense line we have been working on for many years. Didn’t those little ponies responsible for building the line say that this line can’t even be penetrated by tanks? How did the enemy break through the line while we were sleeping? What a shoddy project! It’s because of these idiots that we have to abandon this meaningless defense line, retreat, retreat quickly, we have to establish a new line to stop these reds!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_22_o0]
Don’t panic, Canterlot hasn’t fallen yet.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_23]
Salt Lick City Morning News

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_23_desc]
Good morning, everypony. Welcome to today’s “Salt Lick City Morning News”.
The war situation has changed again today, as the residents of Salt Lick City drag their tired bodies to start another day of “wonderful work”. But they soon find that the flag in the center of Salt Lick City has changed.
In addition, the streets are also full of slogans such as “March for Canterlot!”, “Capture Cozy Glow!”, “Liberate all of Equestria!” and so on. The ponies of Salt Lick City are also looking forward to this rebellion group from Our Town.
——Today will also be the last issue of the “Salt Lick City Morning News”, and the TV station will be closed at noon today. I hope you can continue to maintain an optimistic attitude and wish you all a happy new day!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_23_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_24]
Salt Lick City Liberated!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_24_desc]
Good news, our warriors have successfully captured the most important supply center of the Empire — Salt Lick City. This city has a large amount of wood storage in the Empire, which means that the Empire will face a severe winter problem. In addition, the liberation of this city means that the pseudo-empire has lost the eastern barrier. In the city, our warriors posted slogans such as “March for Canterlot”, “Liberate Equestria” on the streets. It can be seen that this battle has strengthened the belief and confidence of our army to win, and victory is imminent. At present, the army is controlling the Salt Lick City TV station, and the TV station will broadcast the Resistance propaganda film to the residents after the equatism rectification is completed.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_24_o0]
“Testing, Testing, 123”

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_25]
Salt Lick City Marathon

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_25_desc]
Outside the headquarters of the Equestria Empire Ministry of Defence in Canterlot, a junior officer who withdrew from the Salt Lick City front line was reporting the situation on the front line to senior military officers in Canterlot. The junior officer was disheveled, covered in dust, followed by three or five equally shabby soldiers, one of them bandaged her eyes, one bandaged her leg, and one had a large burn on her neck.
“The local news media should have reported to the outside world that this group of reds has been surrounded and controlled by us, and the situation will soon stabilize. But those damn turncoats at the TV station reported the actual situation. The reds... There are too many of them... We ran for a long time, they chased us for a long time, and now our subordinates are still worried, thinking that the reds will suddenly jump out from where.”
When the junior officer finished his account, he was still trembling. The senior military officer in Canterlot looked at his embarrassed appearance, waved his hoof, and the officer and his several subordinates were taken away by the neatly dressed Canterlot guards.
“Damn it.” The senior officer muttered softly, spit out the cigarette in his mouth, stomped it out with his hoof, turned his head and said to his deputy: “It looks like we have to report this to the Empress, where is she now?”
“She is in the castle hall, dealing with national affairs. No one is allowed to disturb her.” The deputy replied.
The officer was suddenly furious: “Damn it, you and I will go see the Empress. If she keeps on dealing with national affairs, we are all done!”

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_25_o0]
Not serious, merely desperate

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_26]
Equestria North Train Suspension Notice

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_26_desc]
Dear honored passenger ponies:
Oh, hello everypony, today I bring you an explosive news, the trains in the Northern Equestria will be suspended from tomorrow!
The Starlight Resistance has taken control of the Equestria North Train Station, which means they will soon have the traffic command of the northern railway area.
From today, ponies will use other means of transportation to travel, at least for the time being, no pony dares to take the train.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_26_o0]
What a hasty notice

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_27]
Equatist Train Station!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_27_desc]
My fellow ponies, the Red Radio is bringing you good news. Just now, our department has completed the battle plan for the Equestria North Train Station. In this battle, the illegal empire officers mistakenly thought that our tactics were still merely mass assault, and that they could defend the train station simply by building a large number of military fortresses to consume our soldiers. However, the enemy officers never expected that our department had captured many new artillery pieces in previous battles. We used artillery to bombard their fortress positions, eliminating many enemy forces, including an enemy general. Our soldiers liberated the train station at a relatively small cost. The liberation of the Equestria North Train Station means that we have completely paralyzed the illegal empire’s northern transportation line, and it also means that it is time to launch a final attack on the illegal empire. Forward, Resistance!

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_27_o0]
Wrong guess, try again.

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_28]
Equestria North Train Station Bugging Log

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_28_desc]
“Knock, knock.” A soldier of the Empire knocked on the door of an office of the Equestria Empire Northern Military District Headquarters outside the Canterlot Palace,
“Commander! I have important information to report!” The soldier’s eyes were firm, even a little excited. This loyal soldier had just retreated from the front line of the North Train Station war zone, which was under fierce attack by the Starlight Resistance.
The soldier noticed that the officers on the front line were not discussing how to respond, but how to run away. He himself had no power to make decisions, but he knew that this was an important strategic point that could not be lost. So he decided to come to the military headquarters and report this to the superiors.
After waiting for half a minute without a response, he couldn’t help but break into the office directly, seeing the senior officers of the military department sitting around the fireplace, smoking and discussing.
“I want to report an act of treason at the Equestria North Train Station! The front-line officers are conspiring to escape!” The soldier stood up straight, saluted the senior officers in the room, and handed over the document - the Equestria North Train Station bugging log that he secretly printed. This soldier was responsible for the monitoring and bugging work in the army.
A senior officer took the document, frowned after reading it, and looked up at the soldier. The soldier also looked at him excitedly, hoping to get a commendation of loyalty.
However, what he got was a stern rebuke: “Aren’t you running back too? Go back to your front line, soldier, and take care of your own business! Don’t waste time reporting such trivial matters!”
The soldier was stunned. He did not expect his loyalty to be misunderstood as cowardice. Tears almost fell from his eyes, but he still held back.
Maybe that’s true. The soldier thought to himself. The senior officers in Canterlot worked day and night, facing the problems of the entire country and the entire front line. They didn’t have time to care about the trivial matter of a regional commander fleeing.
He wasted their time. Thinking of this, the soldier apologized and saluted the room full of serious and angry senior officers with seriousness, and quickly left the office.
After closing the door, the expressions of the senior officers immediately relaxed, they continued to smoke, threw the document into the fireplace and lit it, and continued the topic they had just discussed:
“Where do you think we can sneak out of Canterlot without being discovered by the Empress?”

[en.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_28_o0]
“Who is responsible for bugging us?” “Me.” “Great.”

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_1]
南蹄林城战事

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_1_desc]
星光抵抗军的军队以闪电战的速度拿下了南蹄林城，初步胜利使星光抵抗军的军队士气逐步高涨。
与此同时，乐善也发表声明表示马哈顿市安保部队的援军已集结完毕，随时都可以“收复失地”。但马哈顿安保部队内部也有小马表明南蹄林城的失守已经打乱了安保部队的整个部署，而所谓的援军也只是自欺欺马的谎言，因为该地区失守后，乐善已经把该地区剩余的部队撤至南方地区或者马哈顿城。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_1_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_2]
南蹄林城解放！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_2_desc]
喜报！我们的军队今日已胜利解放南蹄林城！
进入城中的军队得到了城市民众的热烈欢迎，喜悦的小马们走上街头游行，共同迎接蹄林的解放！这座城市经历了长时间的压迫和剥削，小马们生活在贫困和恐惧中。然而，今天是他们摆脱黑暗的日子！抵抗军的军队带来了自由和希望，我们的军队不仅仅是解放者，更是守护者。
解放南蹄林城不仅仅是一场军事胜利，更是对压迫和暴政的有力回击。奴隶主乐善的残军败将已经被彻底击溃，他们在城市各处的据点被我们英勇的士兵一一攻克。奴隶主乐善和他的暴行集团的末路已经近在咫尺，我们相信，通过我们的共同努力，很快整个东小马利亚将实现真正的解放，迎来一个光明的未来！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_2_o0]
好！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_3]
南蹄林城沦陷

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_3_desc]
星光熠熠的抵抗军已经入侵并占据了南蹄林城。他们毫不顾及群众的财产，肆意掠夺，破坏着蹄林在乐善集团下的一切经济建设成果。南蹄林城的居民并不欢迎这些入侵者，他们走上街头游行，抗议“抵抗军”对蹄林的非法入侵。然而，他们遭到了残酷的镇压。
我们必须要记住，他们绝不是在孤军奋战：乐善集团不是一个仅仅关心利润的企业，更是一个富有社会责任感的企业！乐善集团将会积极支持蹄林对于侵略者的反抗，乐善集团将提供一切必要的武器装备和物资援助——以前所未有的6折优惠价格！
为进一步支持蹄林的自由和发展权利，乐善集团宣布从今日起，旗下所有产品价格上调5%，而这5%将全部用于支持蹄林的反抗运动！
支持乐善集团，就是支持蹄林！支持乐善集团，就是支持自由！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_3_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_4]
蹄铁丘战事

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_4_desc]
尽管乐善集团得到了来自小马利亚帝国的军事援助，星光抵抗军的攻势依旧没有被减弱。就在最近，星光抵抗军的军队已经拿下了一个重大的补给中心——蹄铁丘。该地区的沦陷意味着马哈顿的补给来源基本被切断，同时也代表着马哈顿战区与南方战区的联系被切断，马哈顿开始逐步成为一座孤岛。乐善开始动员马哈顿一切可以动员的力量，包括年老的、年幼的甚至是孕妇。此时，小马们意识到马哈顿市将迎来一场大战！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_4_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_5]
蹄铁丘解放！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_5_desc]
最新消息，我们的士兵已经解放了整个蹄铁丘地区！

这个地区具有重要的战略意义，它是一个重要的补给地区，敌军撤退时并未来得及毁坏所有的补给中心和铁路。在当地民众的努力下，铁路修复的很快，相信不久就能重新使用。蹄铁丘的解放也意味着我们将马哈顿的匪帮被彻底孤立，他们将会面临补给匮乏的危机。

值得注意的是，在统计缴获武器的过程中，我们发现，这里的武器有很多产自坎特洛特，这意味着伪帝国开始干涉这场战争，我们将持续关注这方面的消息。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_5_o0]
不错

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_6]
蹄铁丘沦陷

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_6_desc]
敌军的攻势似乎比我们想象的还要迅速，就在刚刚我们收到消息，星光熠熠叛军已经占据了整个蹄铁丘地区，这意味着我们与南方战区的联系正在被切断，整个马哈顿将面临着“叛军威胁”。
因此，从现在开始，马哈顿集团的每一名员工，无论是雌雄，无论老少，无论是居民还是奴...额...努力工作的契约劳工，皆有保卫马哈顿的责任，我们将成立“马哈顿市民自卫军”。除此之外，小马利亚帝国已经同意了对我们的军事援助，这是敌军不愿意看到的，因为他们极度缺乏武器，马哈顿将会是他们的葬身之地。
请相信乐善集团！荣耀属于马哈顿！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_6_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_7]
抵抗军占领马哈顿

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_7_desc]
据《星光电台》报道，抵抗军的军队突破了马哈顿的层层封锁并进入了马哈顿城。尽管商业联盟当局动用了一切手段，例如军舰封锁海峡，城市设立街垒，封锁一切道路等等，但抵抗军的军队仍然突破了封锁。商业联盟方的阵地几乎没有任何顽抗的行为。

马哈顿前任市长乐善目前已经离开了马哈顿，并称“叛军的行为不可容忍，商业联盟将会努力保护每一位小马的安全，并用一切手段收复土地。”而部分从商业联盟出逃的难民则称“商业联盟的安保部队已经崩溃”，乐善能否回到马哈顿仍是未知数。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_7_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_8]
解放马哈顿

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_8_desc]
星光电台紧急报道：我们的军队突破了马哈顿的层层封锁并进入了马哈顿城。尽管商业联盟当局动用了一切手段，例如军舰封锁海峡，城市设立街垒，封锁一切道路等等，但我们的军队仍然突破了封锁。商业联盟方的阵地几乎没有任何顽抗的行为。

领袖星光熠熠已经下令启动马哈顿重建的计划，各位公民们，请听从经济部的调遣，马哈顿需要你！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_8_o0]
自由万岁！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_9]
马哈顿沦陷

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_9_desc]
各位尊敬的马哈顿市民，
我们荣幸的乐善集团成员，不得不告知您，我们的马哈顿分部暂时关闭。您可能已经知道，最近的事件导致星光熠熠的叛军控制了这座城市，严重影响了我们的业务运营。
请放心，亲爱的市民、员工和顾客，我们正在尽一切努力确保员工和资产的安全和福祉。每位未发薪水的员工将在星光熠熠的叛军被击败后得到全额补偿，每位有待订单的顾客将在我们的马哈顿分部重新开业后得到全额退款。我们目前正在与小马利亚帝国当局合作，尽快解决这个问题，我们希望在不久的将来为您重新开放我们的大门。与此同时，请耐心等待进一步通知。
对于可能给您带来的任何不便，我们深表歉意，感谢您的持续支持和理解。
真诚地，
乐善集团

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_9_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_10]
小马德菲亚战事

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_10_desc]
在万籁俱寂的夜晚，小马德菲亚的居民们早已入睡，此时的整座城市已经毫无烟火气息。突然，一阵炮声打破了这个城市宁静的夜晚，毫无疑问，星光抵抗军向该市发起了总攻。尽管炮声震耳，但市民们表现得并不慌张，对他们而言，这是星光抵抗军发起的第n次进攻，每次进攻都使星光抵抗军的军队付出重大伤亡，但收效甚微。这既使城内的乐善集团军洋洋得意，又使小马们逐步适应了这场围城之战。但第二天清晨，小马们发现城市街道上的乐善旗帜早已被换成了星光抵抗军的旗帜。至此，乐善集团在南方战区的屏障就这样被突破了。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_10_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_11]
小马德菲亚解放！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_11_desc]
同志们，我们成功解放了小马德菲亚！我们成功打开了通往南方的大门，这是一场决定性的胜利，乐善的部队已经寥寥无几。
我们牺牲了不少的战士，他们是这场战役的功臣。因为这些英勇的牺牲，我们的攻势绝不会停滞不前。
我们是小马利亚的未来。我们要前进，高声歌唱着埋葬乐善反动集团！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_11_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_12]
小马德菲亚沦陷

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_12_desc]
怎么回事，这些家伙就不睡觉吗？
白天他们对我们发起了多次进攻，尽管我们有不少防线被突破了，但他们也都付出了重大代价，敌军堆积如山的尸体甚至可以“修补”战壕了。我们以为敌军会因为付出如此惨痛的代价而放弃“南下计划”。
事实证明我们想的太天真了，他们选择了深夜偷袭，我们被打的措手不及，我们慌忙逃出了小马德菲亚并眼睁睁的看着敌军的旗帜在城市升起，现在已经没有谁能阻止他们了。
不过还是有一个好消息，乐善集团的欠款应该是不用还了。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_12_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_13]
巴尔的马战事

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_13_desc]
在星光抵抗军南下之前，乐善在南方的重要地区都实行了“堡垒政策”，乐善宣称在层层堡垒和街垒的保护下，星光抵抗军的军队将会承受重大伤亡并无法发起进攻。
但出乎守军意料的是，最坚固的堡垒，往往从内部被攻破——在红色电台的宣传中，巴尔的马的守军不战而溃，星光抵抗军的军队与起义军在短短几天内就攻占了巴尔的马。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_13_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_14]
巴尔的马起义！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_14_desc]
同志们，巴尔的马的小马们做出了正确的选择，他们拿起武器与敌军展开了战斗，经过一天一夜的战斗，小马们拿下了巴尔的马市政厅。红旗已经在巴尔的马升起，乐善反动集团的日子要到头了。
胜利终将属于巴尔的马群众！胜利终将属于抵抗军！胜利终将属于小马利亚的解放事业！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_14_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_15]
巴尔的马叛乱

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_15_desc]
乐善集团月度报告，一段来自巴尔的马驻守部队的视频。
一名年轻的基层安保队副队长在镜头前报告着：
“报告董事会，城内无辜而无知的居民听信了星光熠熠卑劣的虚假宣传，他们的数量实在是太多了，我们在巴尔的马的安保力量被迅速压制，他们很快夺取了整个城市——”
这名副队长被打断了，接下来出现在镜头的是队长：
“但是他们休想继续猖狂下去，我们优质的军队已经集结完毕，随时夺回巴尔的马，我们相信战斗很快就会结束，毕竟这群暴徒只是一些...乌合之众！报告完毕！”
视频结束。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_15_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_16]
可爱标志军团的末日

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_16_desc]
据可靠信息来源，小马利亚帝国的军队已经攻入了暮光城堡，最后一支可爱标记童子军的军队也覆灭于帝国的铁蹄之下。可爱标记童子军的传奇也因此落幕了。为了庆祝这次胜利，和煦女皇在坎特洛特城布置了晚宴以款待各个公爵领的领导者。目前，帝国依旧沉浸在这次“平叛”的胜利喜悦，和煦女皇甚至还未意识到——这只是一场战争的开始，而不是结束。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_16_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_17]
小马利亚帝国清扫无尽之森

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_17_desc]
和煦女皇宣布讨伐一直隐藏在无尽之森的无序军团。帝国方面宣称这次的行动是为了进一步根除小马利亚的隐患以稳住小马谷、坎特洛特以及其他各个地方的动荡局势。
帝国的军队高层对这次行动十分有信心，他们宣称：“日落之前，帝国士兵们就能返回家乡喝下午茶。”
但是他们貌似低估了无序军团的力量，尤其是该军团的头目——无序。并且，据可靠消息，星光抵抗军正在向帝国边境派遣军队，帝国很可能会陷入一场两线作战的持久战争。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_17_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_18]
伟大的和煦女皇的坎特洛特阅兵演讲

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_18_desc]
全体小马，请注意，伟大的和煦女皇发表演讲了：
“我的小马子民们，我很高兴我们做出了讨伐无序叛军这样的决定，这意味着我们帝国的疆域将比以往任何时候都更加稳固。”
“小马利亚帝国将会展现它的强大，这些叛军无非就是一群渣滓而已，我相信，日落之前，帝国士兵们就能返回家乡喝下午茶！”
“我们有学校，他们没有；我们有丰盛的食物，他们连肚子都填不饱；我们有温暖的床，他们只能睡在森林中，这就是我们必胜的理由！”

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_18_o0]
女皇万岁！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_19]
无序的战争动员演讲...?

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_19_desc]
“嘿！今天，我站在你们面前，不再是你们谦卑的小丑，而是混乱的策划者和主宰。是的，我就是无序，混乱之王，来为你们带来一场前所未有的战争动员演讲！”
“嗯...如果你们不明白单口喜剧是怎么回事，我解释一下，现在是时候鼓掌了。”（掌声）
“谢谢！谢谢！现在，想一想，为什么帝国要找到我们？我是说，如果你想找混乱，你根本不用去找别的地方，他们的官僚体系就够混乱的了！”（罐头笑声）
“但不要害怕，我亲爱的森林居民朋友们！我们不会让他们践踏我们珍贵的树木，把永恒森林变成一个混凝土丛林。哦不会的！我们会战斗，我们会用一点魔法，一点疯狂，也许还有一点发光粉，只是为了让他们搞不清楚状况！”（罐头笑声）
“对于我们勇敢的士兵们，我有一些智慧的话要告诉你们。记住，战争就像下象棋，只不过棋盘着火了。”（罐头笑声）
“...棋子有自己的思想。”（罐头笑声）
“...规则每五分钟就变一次。”（罐头笑声）
“...这么说来更像是象棋拳击。”（罐头笑声）
“...或者就更像是拳击。”（罐头笑声）
“...你们还是要记得带枪嗷。”（罐头笑声）
“我的意思是，战争对帝国士兵来说比对我们更加困惑。毕竟，他们得学习适应最新尖端技术装备，几个世纪前的那种。”（罐头笑声）
“而我们，我们没有什么好失去的，却有一切可以获得。所以，我的勇敢的士兵们，前进，全力以赴！”（掌声）

“为了小马利亚！”（“为了小马利亚！”）
“为了混乱！”（“为了混乱！”）
“为了乐子！”（“为了乐子！”，罐头笑声）
“为了永恒自由！这是个双关。”（“为了永恒自由！这是个双关。”）
“嘿，别重复那个啊。”（罐头笑声）

“为了柔柔！”（“为了柔柔！”）

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_19_o0]
“为了柔柔！”

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_20]
高地攻势

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_20_desc]
据可靠消息，星光抵抗军的军队已经突破了帝国在高地设置的防线，高地防线是驹奇诺防线最重要的一环，这意味着驹奇诺防线实际上已经失去了其战略意义，帝国整条战线不得不向后方调整。星光抵抗军此举毫无疑问会增强该部队的信心，但这场战役该军队的损失较大，有可能会影响其攻势的顺利进行。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_20_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_21]
解放高地！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_21_desc]
干得漂亮，小马同志们！我们的战士已经拿下了高地堡垒，这意味着我们已经突破了驹奇诺防线，伪帝国吹嘘的“封锁线”也不过如此嘛。但是我们并不能因此掉以轻心，虽然我们取得了一场重大胜利，但我们并没有因此消灭敌军的有生力量，他们还会集结起来对付我们，我们必须做好下一次的攻势准备。但实话实说，敌军“撤退”速度比王八兔子还快。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_21_o0]
结束了和煦，我占领了高地！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_22]
高地防线失守

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_22_desc]
这是什么情况，我们刚刚收到消息，高地防线失守了！这怎么可能，这是我们多年苦心经营的防线。那帮负责建筑的小马不是说这防线连坦克都打不进去吗？怎么就睡个觉的功夫就让敌军突破了防线，这什么豆腐渣工程！就是因为这些笨蛋，我们不得不放弃这个已经毫无意义的防线了，撤退，快撤退，我们得建立新的防线挡住这群赤色分子！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_22_o0]
慌什么，又没打到坎特洛特。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_23]
盐糊城晨间新闻

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_23_desc]
各位小马们，早上好。欢迎收看今天的“盐糊城晨间新闻”。
今天的战争形势又发生了变化，当盐糊城居民拖着疲惫的身躯准备开始一天的“美好工作”生活。但他们很快发现盐糊城市中心的国旗发生了变化。
除此之外，大街小巷也贴满了“打到坎特洛特！”、“活捉和煦！”、“解放全小马利亚！”等类似标语。盐糊城的小马同样也对这支来自平等镇的队伍充满了期待。
——今天也将会是最后一期的“盐糊城晨间新闻”，电视台将在今天中午关闭。希望大家能够继续保持乐观的心态，祝大家新的一天愉快！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_23_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_24]
盐糊城解放！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_24_desc]
喜报，我们的战士成功攻克了帝国最重要的补给中心——盐糊城。这座城市拥有者帝国大量的木材存储，这意味着帝国将面临着严冬问题。除此之外，这座城市的解放意味着伪帝国已经失去了东部的屏障。在城市里，我们的战士在大街上贴满了“打到坎特洛特”“解放小马利亚”的口号标语。由此可见，此战增强了我军必胜的信念和信心，胜利指日可待。目前军队正在控制盐糊城电视台，电视台将在平等主义整改结束后向居民播放抵抗军宣传片。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_24_o0]
“测试，测试，123”

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_25]
盐糊城马拉松

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_25_desc]
位于坎特洛特的小马利亚帝国国防部总部门外，一名从盐糊城前线撤下来的基层军官正在向坎特洛特高级军官汇报前线情况。这名基层军官衣衫不整，身上全是灰尘，后面跟着三五只同样邋遢的士兵小马，其中一只包扎了眼睛，一只包扎了一条腿，还有一只脖子上有着大片烧伤。
“当地的新闻媒体理应对外报道是这群赤色分子已经被我们包围并控制了起来，局势很快就会稳定。但电视台那群可恶的墙头草竟然把实际情况播报出去了。赤色分子... 他们的数量实在是太多了... 我们跑了许久，他们追了我们许久，直到现在我们的部下还在担惊受怕，以为那群赤色分子会从哪里突然跳出来呢。”
当这名基层军官叙述完的时候，他还在瑟瑟发抖。坎特洛特的高级军官看了看他狼狈的样子，挥了挥蹄，这名军官和他的几个部下被衣着整齐光鲜的坎特洛特卫兵带下去了。
“妈的。”那名高级军官小声嘟囔了一声，将口中的烟吐在地上，用蹄子踩灭，转头对他的副官说道：“看样子我们必须把这件事汇报女皇了，她现在在哪？”
“她在城堡大厅，正在处理国家大事，谁也不能打扰她。”副官回答。
军官顿时怒火中烧：“该死的，你和我一起去见女皇，她再处理她的国家大事，我们都得完蛋！”

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_25_o0]
无足轻重，只是十万火急

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_26]
北小马国火车停运通知

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_26_desc]
尊敬的各位旅客小马们：
噢，各位小马们，你们好，今天我将带来一个爆炸性新闻，小马利亚北部地区的火车从明日起将全部停运！
星光抵抗军已经控制了小马国北车站，这意味着她们很快将会取得北部铁路地区的交通指挥权。
从今天开始，小马们将使用其他交通方式出行，至少这段时间没有小马敢坐火车了。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_26_o0]
多么草率的通知

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_27]
平等主义火车站！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_27_desc]
小马同胞们，红色电台正在为你播报喜讯。就在刚刚，我部已完成了对小马国北火车站的作战计划。此次作战中，伪帝国军官以为我部的战术仍为马海突击战术，只需通过修建大量军事堡垒消耗我方战士即可守住火车站，但敌军军官万万没想到我部在之前的作战中缴获了不少新式火炮，我部使用火炮猛烈轰击他们的堡垒阵地，杀伤了不少敌方有生力量，其中包括一名敌军将军，我们的战士以较小的代价解放了火车站。解放小马国北部火车站，意味着我们彻底瘫痪了伪帝国北方的运输线，也意味着向伪帝国发起总攻的时候到了，前进，抵抗军！

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_27_o0]
猜错了，再试试。

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_28]
小马国北火车站箭头记录

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_28_desc]
“咚、咚。” 一名帝国的士兵拿着一份文件，敲响了坎特洛特皇宫外，小马利亚帝国北军区军部某办公室的大门。
“长官！我有重要信息汇报！” 士兵的眼光坚定，甚至还有些激动。这名忠诚的帝国士兵刚刚从北火车站战区前线撤退回来，那里正在遭到星光抵抗军炮火的猛烈攻击。
这名士兵注意到，前线的军官们并没有在商量如何应对，而是正在商量如何逃跑。他自己没有权力做出决定，但他知道，这是一个重要的战略要点，不能丢失。于是他决定，来到军部，向上级汇报。
在等了半分钟没有得到回应后，他忍不住直接闯入了办公室，看见军部的高级军官们围坐在壁炉前生着火，抽着烟，讨论着。
“我要报告发生在小马国北火车站的一起叛国行为！前线军官在密谋逃跑！” 士兵站直，向屋子里的高级军官们敬礼，并递上了文件——他偷偷打印出来的小马国北火车站监听记录。这名士兵就负责队伍中的监听工作。
一名高级军官接过了文件，看完皱紧了眉头，抬头看了看这名士兵。士兵也激动地看着他，希望得到忠诚的嘉奖。
然而他得到的却是严厉的训斥：“你这不也逃跑回来了吗？回到你的前线去，士兵，管好你自己的事！这种小事情别再上报浪费时间了！”
士兵愣住了，他没有想到自己的忠诚竟然会被误解成胆怯。他的眼泪差点掉下来，但他还是强忍住了。
也许确实是。士兵转念一想，坎特洛特的高级军官们日夜操劳，要面对的是整个国家整条战线的问题，他们没有时间去关心一个地区长官逃跑这种小事。
是自己浪费他们时间了。想到这里，士兵认真而饱含歉意地向一屋子表情严肃而愤怒的高级军官敬礼，迅速转身离开了办公室。
关上门，高级军官们的表情立即变得轻松起来，他们继续抽起烟，将这份文件也扔进了壁炉中生火，并且继续了他们刚才讨论的话题：
“你觉得，我们从坎特洛特哪里可以溜出去而不被女皇发现？”

[zh.EVENT_LIBERATION_WAR_28_o0]
“谁负责监听我们？”“我。”“太好了。”
